  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CODEAM Beninkuyo Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to establish a model cow shed; provide veterinary services; basic equipment; training to improve Cooperative functionality and increase milk production; develop anadministrative and financial procedures manual and business plan; as well as covering key staff members salaries and basic administrative costs.</narrative>
  </description>
